Available MongoDataProvider methods:
- `get_random_user()` - Returns a random user document
- `get_random_item()` - Returns a random item document
- `get_items(limit=10)` - Returns multiple items
- `get_by_id(collection, id)` - Get specific document by ID
- `get_random_from(collection)` - Get random document from any collection

Use MongoDB data for:
